# NestJS Backend Rules

## App Module wiring
```ts
// app.module.ts
@Module({
  imports: [
    ConfigModule.forRoot({ isGlobal: true }),
    SimplamoModule,       // global — exports SimplamoClient
    GoalModule,
    MetricsModule,
    ActionModule,
    OrchestratorModule,
    ChatModule,
  ],
})
export class AppModule {}
```

## Chat Controller — SSE Streaming
```ts
// chat/chat.controller.ts
import { Controller, Post, Body, Res } from '@nestjs/common'
import { Response } from 'express'
import { ChatService } from './chat.service'

@Controller('api')
export class ChatController {
  constructor(private readonly chatService: ChatService) {}

  @Post('chat')
  async chat(
    @Body() body: { message: string },
    @Res() res: Response,
  ) {
    // Set SSE headers manually — tương thích assistant-ui
    res.setHeader('Content-Type', 'text/event-stream')
    res.setHeader('Cache-Control', 'no-cache')
    res.setHeader('Connection', 'keep-alive')
    res.flushHeaders()

    try {
      for await (const chunk of this.chatService.stream(body.message)) {
        res.write(`data: ${JSON.stringify({ content: chunk })}\n\n`)
      }
    } finally {
      res.write('data: [DONE]\n\n')
      res.end()
    }
  }
}
```

## Chat Service — Orchestrator wiring
```ts
// chat/chat.service.ts
@Injectable()
export class ChatService {
  constructor(private readonly orchestrator: OrchestratorService) {}

  async *stream(message: string): AsyncGenerator<string> {
    yield* this.orchestrator.stream(message)
  }
}
```

## Orchestrator Service — routes đến đúng agent
```ts
// agents/orchestrator/orchestrator.agent.ts
@Injectable()
export class OrchestratorService {
  constructor(
    private readonly goalAgent: GoalAgentService,
    private readonly metricsAgent: MetricsAgentService,
    private readonly actionAgent: ActionAgentService,
  ) {}

  async *stream(message: string): AsyncGenerator<string> {
    const intent = await this.classifyIntent(message)

    switch (intent) {
      case 'goal':    yield* this.goalAgent.stream(message); break
      case 'metrics': yield* this.metricsAgent.stream(message); break
      case 'action':  yield* this.actionAgent.stream(message); break
      default:        yield 'Bạn muốn hỏi về mục tiêu, chỉ số hay công việc?'
    }
  }

  private async classifyIntent(message: string): Promise<string> {
    // Dùng LLM nhẹ để classify — không cần full agent loop
    const llm = new ChatOpenAI({ model: 'gpt-4o-mini', temperature: 0 })
    const result = await llm.invoke([
      new SystemMessage('Classify intent as exactly one word: goal, metrics, action, or general'),
      new HumanMessage(message),
    ])
    const intent = result.content.toString().trim().toLowerCase()
    return ['goal', 'metrics', 'action'].includes(intent) ? intent : 'general'
  }
}
```

## main.ts
```ts
async function bootstrap() {
  const app = await NestFactory.create(AppModule)
  app.enableCors({ origin: process.env.FRONTEND_URL || 'http://localhost:3000' })
  app.useGlobalPipes(new ValidationPipe({ whitelist: true, transform: true }))
  await app.listen(process.env.PORT || 4000)
}
```

## Rules
- Orchestrator classify intent bằng gpt-4o-mini (nhanh, rẻ) — không dùng GPT-4o
- Specialist agents dùng gpt-4o (chất lượng cao)
- Controller không chứa logic — chỉ nhận request, stream response
- Mỗi agent là 1 NestJS `@Injectable()` service riêng
- SimplamoModule là `@Global()` — không cần import lại trong từng module
